```

The program crashes with a segmentation fault!  
This means we can replace the address of `m` with the address of `n` (`0x08048454`).


## Payload construction 

We simply write enough bytes to reach the location of the second buffer, then overwrite the address of `m` with the address of `n`:
```
python -c 'print "A"*72 + "\x54\x84\x04\x08"'
```

